; may be (points); a mutant this close and he fights anyway; % he warns the net when he backs off, and hours between warnings
odds_trials = 20
; with amk_odds the offline fight uses these damage factors for stalkers and for mutants (amk_damage_k and
; hunt_damage_k stay for classic): a lone stalker beats one weak mutant, loses to a pack
